# Optional: used only by local `npm run dev` (Vite serve) for the Gemini provider
# when the Settings "Gemini API Key" field is empty.
# Production / Docker / GitHub Pages builds never embed this value.
#
# OpenRouter has no env-var injection — paste an OpenRouter key in Settings
# (Image provider → OpenRouter (BYOK); stored in sessionStorage only).
#
# Prefer setting quotas and billing limits on your own provider keys.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in:
GEMINI_API_KEY=
